From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 18:32:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] vm: use lazy rope concat in add/ConcatToString and direct
 writes in ordinary_set

Route string addition and template concatenation through JsString::concat_owned
so repeated s += chunk loops stay O(N) via ConsString ropes instead of O(N^2)
copying.

Also add a direct own-property write/create fast path in ordinary_set when
receiver === obj and the prototype chain is ordinary, avoiding temporary
PropertyDescriptor allocations and duplicate [[GetOwnProperty]] lookups.
---
